{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁלֶמְיָה(וּ)","hw":"שֶׁלֶמְיָה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁלֶמְיָה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  Jeremiah’s time; Σελεμιου (genit.): <strong>a.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.14\">Je 36:14</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֫הוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.26\">26</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.3\">37:3</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.1\">38:1</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.13\">37:13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Levite, -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.14\">1 Ch 26:14</a>, τῷ Σαλαμεια, etc., = <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁלּוּם</span> <strong>12 a</strong>, q.v.<br><strong>3.</strong>  post-ex. names: <strong>a.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.30\">Ne 3:30</a>, Τελεμια(ς), 𝔊L Σελ´. <strong>b.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.13\">Ne 13:13</a>, priest, Σελεμια(ς) (= <strong>c</strong> or <strong>d</strong>?). <strong>c.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:39\" href=\"/Ezra.10.39\">Ezr 10:39</a>, Σελεμια. <strong>d.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:41\" href=\"/Ezra.10.41\">41</a>, 𝔊 id.","next":"BDB, שַׁלְמָן","prev":"BDB, שְׁלֻמִיאֵל"}